# Squid-fishing boat (오징어잡이배) seen from the side, 112x56, with rows of
# lamps lit. bob_0/bob_1 rock on the water; "ghost" is the same boat as a
# ghost ship, faded, with spirit-green lamps.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 112 56
@output ../characters/boat_squid.png
@preview ../previews/boat_squid_x3.png 3
@columns 1

@frame bob_0
